```
repo:numpy/numpy is:issue is:closed label:Regression path:numpy/polynomial
```
or via GraphQL:

```
query {
  repository(owner:"numpy", name:"numpy") {
    issues(first:100, states:CLOSED, labels:"Regression", filterBy:{path:"numpy/polynomial"}) {
      nodes {
        number
        closedAt
        timelineItems(first:100, itemTypes:LABELED_EVENT) {
          nodes {
            ... on LabeledEvent { createdAt }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

The orchestrator should then instruct the assistant to sort the results by `closedAt` ascending, identify the oldest issue, and examine the `createdAt` of the labeled event to determine when the Regression label was added. This precise guidance would have prevented the assistant’s vague suggestion and led directly to the correct answer (04/15/18).

